    @section fp-fast-math %fp-fast-math

    @par Parse Directive:
    <tt>%%fp-fast-math</tt>

    @par Command Line:
    <tt>-</tt><tt>-set-parse-option=fp-fast-math</tt>

    @par Parse Option Constant:
    @ref Qore::QoreParseOptions::FP_FAST_MATH (string name: \c "fp-fast-math")

    @par Description:
    Enables IEEE-unsafe floating-point optimizer rewrites for the current @ref Qore::Program "Program".
    This option alone does not reorder arithmetic. A registered plugin operation must also set
    \c QorePluginOpcodeInfoExtended::fp_reassociation_allowed before libqore may reassociate,
    vector-reduce, contract, or otherwise change the evaluation order of that operation.

    @note This is an extended parse option (bit 71). The Qore constant \c PO_FP_FAST_MATH
    is defined as \c 0 for compatibility with the legacy 64-bit parse-option space; use
    the string name \c "fp-fast-math" with the @ref Qore::ParseOptions class when setting parse
    options programmatically.

    @since %Qore 3.0

    @see @ref plugin_types

